{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19270","headline":"经伏波神祠 · 刘禹锡","name":"经伏波神祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙蒙篁竹下，有路上壶头。\n汉垒麏鼯鬬，蛮溪雾雨愁。\n怀人敬遗像，阅世指东流。\n自负霸王略，安知恩泽侯。\n乡园辞石柱，筋力尽炎洲。\n一以功名累，飜思马少游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}